France 24 24's International Affairs Commentator Douglas Herbert shares further insights.</summary></entry><entry><title>Spain: At least 10 dead in crash between 2 high-speed trains</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e82d3030f89536ee849c26549b806fb811d24a81e3dd273d637a8eeecfe03f9c</id><updated>2026-10-28T15:13:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T10:11:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261028-spain-at-least-10-dead-in-crash-between-2-high-speed-trains" /><summary type="html">At least ten people have died in a crash between two trains in central Spain. The crash occurred Wednesday morning  in the province of Toledo. Rail service is suspended between Madrid, Ciudad Real and Andalusia.
 
